#Operator_Dashboard_V2<[
Базис:
  MVP dashboard snapshot уже derived из workgraph.snapshot.v1; operator shell v2 добавляет actionable sections без raw .bvc editing.
  Agent Run panel (protocols/operator-agent-run-panel-v1.bvc) заменяет старый ioHasC agent chat window.
Вектор:
  Sections: eligible queue (readyQueue), live-loop state (workerRunSummaries), Agent Run panel (task/provider/run/log), blocked reasons, verification matrix summary, phase roadmap, cycle slice context.
  Read model: operator-shell.snapshot.v2 via buildOperatorShellSnapshotV2().
  UI strip на доске показывает current cycle, ready count, blocked count и next claimable task.
  Agent Run panel MVP: POST /api/agent-run (persist backlog по умолчанию), GET /api/worker-provider-catalog, GET /api/agent-run/journal.
Цель:
  Operator управляет Work Graph OS и запускает worker runs без чтения monolithic backlog и без старого chat UX.

Метки:
  atom.profile: plan
  design.id: operator-dashboard-v2
  work.source: design-workgraph-dashboard-v2
  trace.status: verified
]>
